{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "9f56f7e4-2110-4af0-b0a0-6f48753c5f60",
    "name": "Habitscape API",
    "description": "Local development Postman collection for Habitscape Express API, Food Detection FastAPI service, and BMI FastAPI service.\n\nNotes:\n- Import `Habitscape.local.postman_environment.json` and select it before running requests.\n- Express protected requests use `{{token}}`, which is automatically saved by Register/Login when successful.\n- Image upload requests require updating `{{foodImagePath}}` or manually selecting a local image in Postman.\n- Food ML image requests require the food model artifact at `ML/Habitscape/food-detection/weights/best.pt`.\n- BMI ML prediction requires `bmi_model_new.keras` and `scaler_bmi_new.pkl`.\n- Express food analyze may fail until the Express-to-FastAPI contract is aligned.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const now = new Date();",
          "pm.environment.set('today', now.toISOString().slice(0, 10));"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('Status is not 500 Internal Server Error', function () {",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.not.eql(500);",
          "});",
          "",
          "const contentType = pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type') || '';",
          "if (contentType.includes('application/json')) {",
          "  pm.test('Response is valid JSON', function () {",
          "    pm.response.json();",
          "  });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
